    ["Tus hechizos golpean a 1 objetivo más."] = "Your spells strike 1 more target.",
    ["Guerrero"] = "Warrior",
    ["Imparable en plena refriega. Muchísima salud, tajos que rajan y cada muerte alimenta la furia."] = "Unstoppable in the thick of it. Huge health, cleaving swings, and every kill feeds the fury.",
    ["Paladín"] = "Paladin",
    ["Suelo sagrado y martillos justicieros. Se sana a sí mismo y, de vez en cuando, se libra de la muerte."] = "Holy ground and righteous hammers. Heals himself, shrugs off death once in a while.",
    ["Cazador"] = "Hunter",
    ["Muerte a distancia. Flechas, trampas y descargas, mientras mantengas la distancia."] = "Death from range. Arrows, traps and volleys, as long as you keep your distance.",
    ["Pícaro"] = "Rogue",
    ["Rápido, frágil y letal. El héroe más veloz, con críticos que borran élites."] = "Fast, fragile and lethal. The quickest hero, with crits that delete elites.",
    ["Sacerdote"] = "Priest",
    ["Luz y Sombra. Escudos y sanaciones te mantienen con vida mientras el dolor se extiende por la horda."] = "Light and Shadow. Shields and heals keep you alive while pain spreads through the horde.",
    ["Chamán"] = "Shaman",
    ["Tormentas que saltan de enemigo en enemigo y tótems que luchan a tu lado."] = "Storms that jump from foe to foe, and totems that fight beside you.",
    ["Mago"] = "Mage",
    ["El cañón de cristal. El mayor daño en área de Azeroth, y nada tras lo que esconderse."] = "The glass cannon. The biggest area damage in Azeroth, and nothing to hide behind.",
