    ["默认"] = "Defaults",
    ["完成"] = "Done",
    ["点击一个按键，然后按下要绑定的键、鼠标按钮或滚轮。右键点击按键可解除绑定。"] = "Click a key, then press the key, mouse button or wheel to bind to it. Right-click a key to unbind it.",
    ["插件对所有英雄统一开启或关闭，下次冒险时加载。"] = "AddOns are turned on or off for every hero and load at your next run.",
    ["导入存档会用文件中的进度替换你的全部进度。"] = "Importing a save replaces all of your progress with the one in the file.",
    ["左摇杆移动，右摇杆转动视角，A键跳跃，肩键和扳机键缩放，Y键打开保留的升级。更改立即生效。"] = "Left stick moves, right stick turns the view, A jumps, bumpers and triggers zoom, Y opens stored level-ups. Changes apply at once.",
