    ["移除"] = "Remove",
    ["把你的进度（英雄、各职业已开放的区域、装备、天赋和图鉴）保存为文件：可以留作备份，也可以带到另一台电脑或浏览器。"] = "Your progress (heroes, the zones each class has opened, gear, talents and the codex) as a file: to keep a copy, or to carry it to another computer or browser.",
