    ["在收藏或掉落表中选择一件装备，查看它的加成和掉落它的首领；或选择左侧的部位来选择其外观。"] = "Pick a piece in the collection or the drop tables to see what it adds and which bosses drop it, or a slot on the left to choose its look.",
