    ["战士"] = "Warrior",
    ["在乱战中势不可挡。巨量生命值、横扫的挥砍，每一次击杀都在助长怒火。"] = "Unstoppable in the thick of it. Huge health, cleaving swings, and every kill feeds the fury.",
