    ["猎人"] = "Hunter",
    ["远程的死亡。箭矢、陷阱与齐射，只要你保持距离。"] = "Death from range. Arrows, traps and volleys, as long as you keep your distance.",
    ["潜行者"] = "Rogue",
    ["迅捷、脆弱而致命。速度最快的英雄，暴击能秒杀精英。"] = "Fast, fragile and lethal. The quickest hero, with crits that delete elites.",
    ["牧师"] = "Priest",
    ["圣光与暗影。护盾和治疗让你活下去，痛苦在敌群中蔓延。"] = "Light and Shadow. Shields and heals keep you alive while pain spreads through the horde.",
    ["萨满祭司"] = "Shaman",
    ["在敌人间跳跃的风暴，以及与你并肩作战的图腾。"] = "Storms that jump from foe to foe, and totems that fight beside you.",
    ["法师"] = "Mage",
    ["玻璃大炮。艾泽拉斯最强的范围伤害，却无处藏身。"] = "The glass cannon. The biggest area damage in Azeroth, and nothing to hide behind.",
    ["术士"] = "Warlock",
    ["诅咒与火焰。持续伤害叠加在每一个追逐你的敌人身上。"] = "Curses and fire. Damage over time stacks up on everything that chases you.",
