    ["狗头人从玉石矿洞涌出，豺狼人渡过河流，迪菲亚兄弟会进军农场。他们的首领在最后等着你。"] = "Kobolds pour out of Jasperlode Mine, gnolls cross the river and the Defias Brotherhood marches on the farms. Their leader waits for you at the end.",
