    ["做工朴素，却能让打击落在要害。"] = "Plain work, but it helps a blow land where it hurts.",
    ["结实耐用，只是不太好看。"] = "Sturdy, if nothing much to look at.",
    ["非常合身，让穿戴者时刻精神饱满。"] = "Well fitted; it keeps its wearer fresh and ready.",
    ["轻便合体，从不拖慢你的脚步。"] = "Light and well cut; it never slows you down.",
    ["简单舒适，便于休息。"] = "Simple, comfortable, and easy to rest in.",
    ["厚实温暖，适合长途跋涉。"] = "Thick and warm, made for long days on the road.",
    ["为快速移动和重击而裁制。"] = "Cut for moving quickly and hitting hard.",
    ["工匠眼光独到，穿戴者也会如此。"] = "Its maker had a good eye, and so will its wearer.",
    ["被上百次致命一击砍出了缺口。"] = "Notched by a hundred killing blows.",
    ["锻打得足够厚实，能挡开斧头。"] = "Hammered thick enough to turn an axe.",
    ["为永不厌倦冲锋的人所穿戴。"] = "Worn by those who never tire of the charge.",
    ["轻得足以抢先接敌，并找到其盔甲的缝隙。"] = "Light enough to reach the foe first, and find the gap in its armor.",
    ["老兵的装备：伤口愈合，下一击已就绪。"] = "A veteran's gear: the wounds close, and the next blow is ready.",
    ["为流血仍屹立不倒的人而制。"] = "Made for those who bleed and keep standing.",
    ["专为追杀逃敌而制。"] = "Made for running down what flees.",
    ["每一次挥刃都能触及更远。"] = "Every sweep of the blade carries further.",
    ["受到祝福，用以惩戒邪恶。"] = "Blessed for the smiting of the wicked.",
    ["奉献之钢：圣光挡开了打击。"] = "Consecrated steel: the Light turns the blow aside.",
    ["圣光迅速回应穿戴者的祈祷。"] = "The Light answers its bearer's prayers swiftly.",
    ["正义之手迅捷而坚定。"] = "Swift is the hand of justice, and sure.",
    ["信仰在审判之间治愈穿戴者。"] = "Faith mends its bearer between judgements.",
    ["圣光让穿戴者超越凡人的极限屹立不倒。"] = "The Light keeps its bearer standing past mortal limits.",
    ["献给践踏天灾的十字军。"] = "For the crusader who rides down the Scourge.",
    ["其神圣光辉广为散布，灼烧精准。"] = "Its holy radiance spreads wide and burns true.",
    ["每一箭都射中心脏。"] = "Every shot finds the heart.",
    ["取自一头不肯死去的野兽。"] = "Cut from a beast that would not die.",
    ["目光敏锐、不知疲倦，随时准备再射。"] = "Keen-eyed and tireless, ever ready to loose again.",
    ["追踪时轻盈，射击时精准。"] = "Light on the trail, sure on the shot.",
    ["耐心的猎人稍作休息，布下下一个陷阱。"] = "The patient hunter rests, and readies the next trap.",
    ["为在荒野中度过漫长季节而制。"] = "Made for long seasons in the wild.",
    ["与兽群一同奔跑，一同撕咬。"] = "Runs with the pack, and bites with it.",
    ["居高临下，无物能逃出其射程。"] = "From high above, nothing escapes its reach.",
    ["为终结一切的那一击而制。"] = "Made for the strike that ends it.",
    ["暗处镶着铆钉，以备战斗出了岔子。"] = "Studded beneath the shadows, for the fight that goes wrong.",
    ["穿戴者总留有后手。"] = "Its wearer is never caught without a trick ready.",
    ["脚步飞快，背后的刀更快。"] = "Quick feet, and a quicker blade in the back.",
    ["在阴影中喘口气；下一个把戏已经准备好了。"] = "Catch your breath in the shadows; the next trick is ready.",
    ["献给从每次伏击中全身而退的人。"] = "For the one who walks out of every ambush.",
    ["冲进去，一刀，消失。"] = "Dart in, cut, gone.",
    ["其飞刀扇形散开，直取要害。"] = "Its knives fan wide and find the vitals.",
    ["神圣之怒与暗影同样精准。"] = "Holy wrath and shadow alike strike true.",
    ["织入了抵御伤害的护符。"] = "Woven with wards against harm.",
    ["穿戴者的祈祷很快得到回应。"] = "Its wearer's prayers are answered swiftly.",
    ["步伐轻盈，言语笃定。"] = "Light of step and certain of word.",
    ["冥想织入了每一根丝线。"] = "Meditation woven into every thread.",
    ["受到祝福，支撑穿戴者度过任何考验。"] = "Blessed to sustain its wearer through any trial.",
    ["狂热者的服饰，为投身战斗而制。"] = "The zealot's garb, made to walk into the fray.",
    ["其祝福远达四方，精准降临。"] = "Its blessings reach far and fall true.",
    ["风暴之怒被封印在符文之中。"] = "The fury of the storm, bound in its runes.",
    ["受到大地之灵的祝福。"] = "Blessed by the spirits of the earth.",
    ["元素毫不迟疑地回应穿戴者。"] = "The elements answer its wearer without delay.",
    ["风托起穿戴者，引导其打击。"] = "The wind carries its wearer, and guides the strike.",
    ["水的耐心：它治愈，它回归。"] = "Water's patience: it heals, and it returns.",
    ["潮汐一次又一次恢复穿戴者。"] = "The tides restore its wearer, again and again.",
    ["幽魂之狼在穿戴者身旁奔跑。"] = "The spirit wolf runs at its wearer's side.",
    ["其闪电跳得很远，击中精准。"] = "Its lightning leaps far and strikes true.",
    ["奥术符文让每个法术更加锋利。"] = "Arcane runes sharpen every spell.",
    ["丝线中蕴藏着冰霜护盾。"] = "Its threads hold a ward of frost.",
    ["其织纹加速下一个法术。"] = "Its weave hastens the next spell.",
    ["比空气还轻，精准如闪现。"] = "Lighter than air, and precise as a blink.",
    ["奥术在施法间隙治愈穿戴者。"] = "The arcane mends its wearer between spells.",
    ["经过附魔，能承受足以击倒普通法师的打击。"] = "Enchanted to endure what would fell lesser magi.",
    ["边走边施法，而且威力十足。"] = "Spells loosed on the move, and loosed hard.",
    ["其暴风雪覆盖更广，啃噬更深。"] = "Its blizzards fall wider and bite deeper.",
    ["缝线旁的邪能符文渴望杀戮。"] = "Fel runes along its seams hunger for the kill.",
    ["以恶魔之皮装订。"] = "Bound with a demon's hide.",
    ["契约赐予生命，以及更快恢复的法术。"] = "The pact grants life, and spells that return sooner.",
    ["暗影加快穿戴者的速度，引导诅咒命中目标。"] = "Shadow hastens its wearer and guides the curse home.",
    ["从垂死者身上汲取的生命治愈穿戴者。"] = "Life siphoned from the dying mends its wearer.",
    ["穿戴者的生命由一个被束缚的灵魂锚定。"] = "Its wearer's life is anchored by a bound soul.",
    ["地狱猎犬之皮，为追猎而制。"] = "Felhunter leather, made for the chase.",
    ["其暗影烈焰扩散得很远，灼烧得很深。"] = "Its shadowflame spreads far and burns deep.",
    ["锋利如巨猫之爪。"] = "Sharp as the great cat's claws.",
    ["厚实如巨熊之皮。"] = "Thick as the hide of the great bear.",
    ["自然的馈赠很快回到穿戴者身上。"] = "Nature's gifts return swiftly to its wearer.",
    ["迅捷如雄鹿，精准如利爪。"] = "Swift as the stag, sure as the claw.",
    ["睿智如枭兽；自然在施法间隙治愈。"] = "Wise as the moonkin; nature mends between spells.",
    ["翡翠梦境支撑着穿戴者。"] = "The Emerald Dream sustains its wearer.",
    ["为狩猎而制，跟上兽群的步伐。"] = "Made for the hunt, at the pace of the pack.",
    ["自然之怒远达四方，击中精准。"] = "Nature's wrath reaches far and strikes true.",
