    ["终极天赋。你以巨熊形态战斗：最大生命值提高25%，受到的伤害降低10%。每3秒你周围会撕扯出一次免费的挥击，挥击每命中一个敌人都会为你恢复最大生命值的0.3%。每次冒险开始时你拥有撕碎而不是愤怒。你无法同时学习猎豹形态。"] = "Capstone. You fight in Dire Bear Form: 25% more maximum health and 10% less damage taken. A free Swipe tears around you every 3 sec, and every enemy Swipe hits heals you for 0.3% of your maximum health. You start every run with Shred instead of Wrath. You can't also learn Cat Form.",
    ["猎豹形态"] = "Cat Form",
    ["终极天赋。你以猎豹形态战斗：伤害提高10%，暴击几率提高10%，移动速度提高15%，撕碎的冷却时间缩短20%。每次冒险开始时你拥有撕碎而不是愤怒。你无法同时学习巨熊形态。"] = "Capstone. You fight in Cat Form: 10% more damage, 10% more critical strike chance and 15% faster movement, and Shred's cooldown is 20% shorter. You start every run with Shred instead of Wrath. You can't also learn Dire Bear Form.",
