    ["伙伴"] = "Companion",
    ["一个伙伴会陪你走过每次冒险，扫荡拾取范围外最远25码内的金币和经验光球：它有自己的拾取范围（你的四分之一），所经之处尽数捡起，每趟之间休息2秒。从不捡磁铁或宝箱。"] = "A companion follows you through every run and sweeps up the coins and experience wisps up to 25 yd beyond your pickup radius: all within a pickup radius of its own, a quarter of yours, resting 2 sec between trips. Never a magnet or a cache.",
    ["长绳"] = "Long Leash",
    ["你的伙伴会捡回拾取范围外最远35码的物品。"] = "Your companions fetch up to 35 yd beyond your pickup radius.",
