    ["血色十字军将大教堂对整个世界紧闭。武僧与狂热者挤满了花园和中殿，大检察官怀特迈恩在祭坛前等待复活倒下的人。"] = "The Scarlet Crusade bars the cathedral against the world. Monks and zealots fill the garden and the nave, and at the altar High Inquisitor Whitemane waits to raise the fallen.",
