    ["天灾入侵"] = "The Scourge Invasion",
    ["纳克萨玛斯悬浮在瘟疫之地上空，它的主人在冰冷的大厅中等待。他的副官们从憎恶伫立的壁龛中走出，当他们倒下时，克尔苏加德便从王座上站起。"] = "Naxxramas hangs over the Plaguelands, and its master waits in his frozen chamber. His lieutenants step out of the alcoves where the abominations stand, and when they fall, Kel'Thuzad rises from his throne.",
