    ["里程碑。每4秒随机召唤3个低阶恶魔，持续12–16秒（最多12个）。\n魅魔会击晕受你的腐蚀术影响的敌人。它们的击杀会触发一次伤害为50%的死亡缠绕。"] = "Milestone. Every 4 sec, summon 3 random lesser demons for 12–16 sec (max 12).\nSuccubi stun Corrupted enemies. Their kills trigger a Death Coil at 50% damage.",
    ["你的地狱火和末日守卫变为永久存在。你无法再召唤低阶恶魔。每种最多一个。"] = "Your Infernal and Doomguard become permanent. You can no longer summon lesser demons. Maximum one of each.",
