  tpl = {
    { "^终极天赋。每30秒召唤一个恶魔卫士，持续(.-)秒，间隔受冷却缩减影响（最少13秒）。最多同时存在2个。\n顺劈15码内最多10个敌人。每第三次挥砍造成双倍伤害。对生命值低于30%%的敌人造成的伤害提高50%%。\n与安尼赫兰契约互斥。$", { "v" }, "Capstone. Summons a Felguard for {v} sec every 30 sec, reduced by CDR (min 13 sec). Up to 2 active.\nCleaves up to 10 enemies within 15 yd. Every third swing deals double damage. Deals 50% more damage below 30% enemy health.\nExclusive with Pact of the Annihilan." },
    { "^里程碑。永久召唤一个击中2个敌人的虚空行者。你每拥有1%%伤害减免，它的伤害提高3%%；每拥有1%%额外最大生命值，提高2%%。\n你的虚空行者会为你提供相当于其伤害(.-)%%的护盾，最多为你最大生命值的25%%。\n与灵魂吞噬者互斥。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. Permanently summons a Voidwalker that hits 2 enemies. Gains 3% damage per 1% Damage Reduction and 2% per 1% bonus max health.\nYour Voidwalkers shield you for {v}% of their damage, up to 25% of your max health.\nRules out Soul Devourer." },
    { "^里程碑。永久召唤一只地狱猎犬。它的撕咬击中2个敌人，优先首领和精英，敌人每损失1%%生命值，伤害提高(.-)%%。\n吞噬魔法：吞噬你等级最高的持续伤害效果剩余持续时间的10%%，造成所吞噬伤害的150%%。\n与灵魂链接互斥。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. Permanently summons a Felhunter. Its bites hit 2 enemies, prioritizing bosses and elites, and deal {v}% more damage per 1% missing enemy health.\nConsume Magic: Consumes 10% of your highest-ranked DoT's remaining duration, dealing 150% of the consumed damage.\nRules out Soul Link." },
    { "^你的攻击积累连击点数，暴击积累两点，每秒最多(.-)点。达到5点时，一次免费的剔骨会对(.-)码内的(.-)造成(.-)点物理伤害，对生命值低于30%%的敌人伤害翻倍。优先攻击首领和精英，然后是生命值低于30%%且伤势最重的敌人。$", { "per_sec", "range", "whom", "dmg" }, "Your strikes build combo points, a critical strike two, at most {per_sec} a second. At 5 points a free Eviscerate strikes {whom} within {range} yd for {dmg} Physical damage, doubled against an enemy below 30% health. Bosses and elites are targeted first, then the most wounded below 30% health." },
    { "^终极天赋。每30秒召唤一个深渊领主，持续(.-)秒，间隔受冷却缩减影响（最少13秒）。最多同时存在2个。\n邪能追猎继承你的灼热之痛强化，对其主要目标造成的伤害提高25%%。最多命中6个敌人。\n与屠夫互斥。$", { "v" }, "Capstone. Summons a Pit Lord for {v} sec every 30 sec, reduced by CDR (min 13 sec). Up to 2 active.\nFelseeker inherits your Searing Pain upgrades and deals 25% more damage to its primary target. It hits up to 6 enemies.\nExclusive with Butcher." },
    { "^你的法术有(.-)%%的几率将命中的敌人变成绵羊，每(.-)秒最多一只，同时最多(.-)只。首领和守护者免疫。绵羊会无害地游荡(.-)秒，下一次攻击会使其爆开，对(.-)码内的所有敌人造成相当于其最大生命值(.-)%%（最多(.-)点）的奥术伤害。$", { "p", "iv", "sheep", "secs", "r", "pop", "dmg" }, "Your spells have a {p}% chance to turn the enemy they hit into a sheep, at most one every {iv} sec and {sheep} at once. Bosses and guardians are immune. A sheep wanders harmlessly for {secs} sec, and the next hit on it pops it in an arcane burst of {pop}% of its maximum health, up to {dmg}, on every enemy within {r} yd." },
    { "^标记(.-)码内的(.-)，优先标记首领或精英。你对被标记敌人的攻击会将(.-)%%的伤害（最多(.-)点）以自然伤害弧跳到其(.-)码内最近的(.-)个敌人身上，每个标记每秒最多(.-)次。被标记的敌人死亡时，标记会转移到附近的敌人身上。$", { "range", "whom", "p", "dmg", "r", "arcs", "per_sec" }, "Marks {whom} within {range} yd, a boss or an elite first. Your hits on a marked enemy arc {p}% of their damage, up to {dmg}, as Nature damage to the {arcs} enemies nearest it within {r} yd, at most {per_sec} times a second for each mark. When a marked enemy dies, its mark moves to one nearby." },
    { "^你的伤害法术有5%%的几率召唤一个末日守卫，持续15秒（最多1个）。它的暗影箭击中2个敌人，并继承你的强化。\n末日使者：对同一首领或精英的连续命中造成的伤害提高20%%，最多提高(.-)%%。$", { "v" }, "Your damaging spells have a 5% chance to summon a Doomguard for 15 sec (max 1). Its Shadow Bolts hit 2 enemies and inherit your upgrades.\nDoom Bringer: Consecutive hits on the same boss or elite deal 20% more damage, up to {v}%." },
    { "^里程碑。你的毛皮变厚：最大生命值提高20%%，受到的伤害降低8%%。每次冒险开始时你就拥有挥击和撕碎，所有被它们命中的目标都会流血，在6秒内受到相当于该次攻击(.-)%%的伤害。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. Your hide thickens: 20% more maximum health and 8% less damage taken. You start every run with Swipe and Shred, and everything they hit bleeds for {v}% of the blow over 6 sec." },
    { "^里程碑。每次冒险开始时你就拥有制裁之锤。每次奉献都会生成相当于你最大生命值(.-)%%的护盾，最多叠加到30%%（有神佑之身时为39%%）；护盾存在时，你造成的伤害提高20%%。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. You start every run with Hammer of Justice. Every Consecration raises a shield of {v}% of your maximum health, stacking up to 30% (39% with Blessed Life), and while a shield holds, you deal 20% more damage." },
    { "^终极天赋。每次冒险开始时你拥有奥术飞弹而不是火球术，且法术打击两次的几率提高(.-)%%。你的回响会连锁：因几率打击两次的法术会再判定一次以再打击一次，最多连续额外3次。$", { "v" }, "Capstone. You start every run with Arcane Missiles instead of Fireball, and your spells strike twice {v}% more often. Your echoes cascade: a spell that strikes twice by chance rolls again to strike once more, up to 3 more times in a row." },
    { "^里程碑。你的暗影箭带来黑夜：每一枚命中的暗影箭都会腐蚀目标，在12秒内造成相当于该箭(.-)%%的伤害；腐蚀术的每一跳有2%%的几率射出一枚免费的暗影箭，每秒最多两次。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. Your Shadow Bolts carry the night: each one that lands corrupts its target for {v}% of the bolt over 12 sec, and every tick of Corruption has a 2% chance to fire a free Shadow Bolt, at most twice a second." },
    { "^终极天赋。整次冒险中你都处于暗影形态，带有暗言术：痛的敌人死亡时会爆炸，对6码内的一切造成相当于其最大生命值(.-)%%的伤害，痛苦会跳到离它最近的敌人身上。$", { "v" }, "Capstone. You take on Shadowform for the whole run, and when an enemy dies with Shadow Word: Pain on it, it bursts for {v}% of its maximum health on everything within 6 yd and the pain jumps to the enemy nearest it." },
    { "^里程碑。每次盾牌猛击都会生成相当于你最大生命值(.-)%%的护盾，最多叠加到30%%（有盾牌掌握时为42%%）；护盾存在时，你造成的伤害提高20%%。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. Every Shield Slam raises a shield of {v}% of your maximum health, stacking up to 30% (42% with Shield Mastery), and while a shield holds, you deal 20% more damage." },
    { "^标记(.-)码内最强壮的敌人：它受到的所有伤害提高(.-)%%。它死亡时标记会爆炸，对(.-)码内的所有敌人造成(.-)点奥术伤害，每(.-)秒最多一次，一秒后标记下一个敌人。$", { "range", "p", "r", "dmg", "iv" }, "Marks the toughest enemy within {range} yd: it takes {p}% more damage from everything. When it dies the mark explodes, dealing {dmg} Arcane damage to every enemy within {r} yd, at most once every {iv} sec, and a second later marks the next." },
    { "^终极天赋。每次冒险开始时你就拥有炎爆术，被你的火焰法术击杀的敌人会爆炸，对6码内的一切造成相当于其最大生命值(.-)%%的伤害，每秒最多3次。$", { "v" }, "Capstone. You start every run with Pyroblast, and enemies killed by your Fire spells explode for {v}% of their maximum health on everything within 6 yd, at most 3 a second." },
    { "^你的每次命中积累(.-)点怒气，每秒最多(.-)点。怒气达到100时你会爆发，对(.-)码内的所有敌人造成(.-)点物理伤害，每(.-)秒最多一次。停止战斗时怒气会流失。$", { "rage", "per_sec", "r", "dmg", "iv" }, "Each of your hits fills {rage} rage, at most {per_sec} a second. At 100 rage you erupt, dealing {dmg} Physical damage to every enemy within {r} yd, at most once every {iv} sec. Rage drains when you stop fighting." },
    { "^终极天赋。每次冒险开始时你就拥有腐蚀术，受你的持续伤害效果影响而死的敌人会爆裂，对6码内的一切造成相当于其最大生命值(.-)%%的伤害。$", { "v" }, "Capstone. You start every run with Corruption, and enemies that die afflicted by your damage-over-time effects burst for {v}% of their maximum health on everything within 6 yd." },
    { "^你的伤害法术有5%%的几率召唤一个地狱火，持续15秒（最多1个）。它的陨石落地时击晕敌人，并以(.-)%%的效果用地狱烈焰灼烧附近的敌人。$", { "v" }, "Your damaging spells have a 5% chance to summon an Infernal for 15 sec (max 1). Its Meteor stuns enemies on impact, and it burns nearby enemies with Hellfire at {v}% effectiveness." },
    { "^里程碑。每次冒险开始时你就拥有暗言术：痛而不是惩击，它的每一跳有(.-)%%的几率释放一个暗影幻灵：一次免费的心灵震爆，每秒最多两次。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. You start every run with Shadow Word: Pain instead of Smite, and its ticks have a {v}% chance to loose a shadowy apparition: a free Mind Blast, at most twice a second." },
    { "^你击杀的敌人有(.-)%%的几率爆发圣光，对尸体(.-)码内的所有敌人造成(.-)点神圣伤害。爆发造成的击杀可能再引发一次爆发。每秒最多两次爆发。$", { "p", "r", "dmg" }, "Enemies you slay have a {p}% chance to burst in holy light, dealing {dmg} Holy damage to every enemy within {r} yd of the body. A burst's kills may set off one more. At most two bursts a second." },
    { "^里程碑。每次冒险开始时你就拥有献祭。暗影箭和灼热之痛会使受到献祭的敌人爆炸，对其6码内的所有敌人造成该次攻击伤害的(.-)%%。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. Start every run with Immolate. Shadow Bolt and Searing Pain make Immolated enemies explode for {v}% of the hit's damage within 6 yd." },
    { "^向(.-)码内的随机敌人发射(.-)枚飞弹，每枚造成(.-)；附近有首领或精英时，全部射向它们。附近敌人很少时，多枚飞弹可能命中同一个敌人。$", { "range", "n", "hit" }, "Fires {n} missiles at random enemies within {range} yd for {hit} each, all of them at bosses and elites when any are near. With few enemies near, several can hit the same one." },
    { "^里程碑。每次冒险开始时你就拥有真言术：盾，你身上的护盾破碎时会爆发圣光：其吸收量的(.-)%%打击10码内的所有敌人。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. You start every run with Power Word: Shield, and a shield on you that breaks bursts in holy light: {v}% of what it absorbed strikes every enemy within 10 yd." },
    { "^对(.-)码内的(.-)造成(.-)，对生命值低于30%%的敌人翻倍为(.-)。优先攻击首领和精英，然后是生命值低于30%%且伤势最重的敌人。$", { "range", "enemies", "hit", "dmg" }, "Strikes {enemies} within {range} yd for {hit}, doubled to {dmg} against an enemy below 30% health. Bosses and elites are targeted first, then the most wounded below 30% health." },
    { "^里程碑。每次盾牌猛击都会从第一个目标处发出震荡波：其8码内的所有敌人受到相当于该次攻击(.-)%%的伤害并被击晕。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. Each Shield Slam sends a shockwave from its first target: every enemy within 8 yd of it is struck for {v}% of the blow and stunned." },
    { "^终极天赋。每次冒险开始时你就拥有瞄准射击；其冷却时间缩短(.-)%%，致命一击会使其立即冷却完毕，每2秒最多一次。$", { "v" }, "Capstone. You start every run with Aimed Shot; its cooldown is {v}% shorter and a killing blow readies it again, at most every 2 sec." },
    { "^终极天赋。每次冒险开始时你拥有背刺而非邪恶攻击，背刺和剔骨会将其伤害的(.-)%%溅射到目标5码内的所有敌人身上。$", { "v" }, "Capstone. You start every run with Backstab instead of Sinister Strike, and Backstab and Eviscerate splash {v}% of their damage onto every enemy within 5 yd of their target." },
    { "^里程碑。顺劈斩、致死打击和斩杀会横扫开来：每次命中还会对目标附近的2个敌人造成相当于该次攻击(.-)%%的伤害。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. Cleave, Mortal Strike and Execute sweep on: each hit also strikes 2 more enemies near its target for {v}% of it." },
    { "^终极天赋。每次冒险开始时你就拥有驱邪术，每次驱邪术都会在目标身上爆发，对5码内的所有敌人造成(.-)%%的效果。$", { "v" }, "Capstone. You start every run with Exorcism, and every Exorcism bursts on its target, striking every enemy within 5 yd for {v}% of it." },
    { "^终极天赋。一只迅猛龙加入你的狼，你的宠物的撕咬还会撕裂附近的2个敌人，造成相当于该次撕咬(.-)%%的伤害。$", { "v" }, "Capstone. A raptor joins your wolf, and your pets' bites tear through 2 more enemies nearby for {v}% of the bite." },
    { "^你的击杀会收集灵魂碎片，每(.-)秒最多一个。达到5个碎片时，一次免费的灵魂之火会对(.-)码内的(.-)造成(.-)点火焰伤害。$", { "secs", "range", "whom", "dmg" }, "Your kills gather soul shards, at most one every {secs} sec. At 5 shards a free Soulfire strikes {whom} within {range} yd for {dmg} Fire damage." },
    { "^里程碑。被你的自动射击或多重射击击杀的敌人会爆炸，对6码内的一切造成相当于其最大生命值(.-)%%的伤害。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. Enemies killed by your Auto Shot or Multi-Shot explode for {v}% of their maximum health on everything within 6 yd." },
    { "^一只小鬼永久在你身边作战，其火焰箭的威力提高(.-)%%。每一枚火焰箭还会击中所有正受你的献祭灼烧的敌人。$", { "v" }, "An Imp fights at your side for good, its Firebolts {v}% stronger. Each one also strikes every enemy burning with your Immolate." },
    { "^里程碑。每次击杀有(.-)%%的几率撕开一道裂隙：一只小鬼跳出来，在你身边作战15秒，最多同时存在5只。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. Each kill has an {v}% chance to tear open a rift: an Imp leaps out and fights beside you for 15 sec, up to 5 at once." },
    { "^在一个敌人身上最多叠加(.-)次：首领和精英优先承受全部层数，然后是尚未受折磨的敌人，然后是其余敌人。$", { "cap" }, " Stacks up to {cap} times on one enemy: bosses and elites take every stack first, then enemies not yet afflicted, then the rest." },
    { "^终极天赋。中毒或流血而死的敌人会化作毒云爆发，对7码内的一切造成相当于其最大生命值(.-)%%的伤害。$", { "v" }, "Capstone. Enemies that die poisoned or bleeding burst in a toxic cloud for {v}% of their maximum health on everything within 7 yd." },
    { "^终极天赋。一个恶魔卫士加入你的恶魔，每个恶魔的攻击都会劈砍目标附近的2个敌人，造成(.-)%%的效果。$", { "v" }, "Capstone. A Felguard joins your demons, and every demon's blow cleaves 2 more enemies near its target for {v}% of it." },
    { "^每(.-)秒，当敌人进入(.-)码内时，你所站之处会升起一座光束泉。在(.-)秒内，它每秒对其(.-)码内的(.-)造成(.-)点神圣伤害。$", { "iv", "near", "dur", "range", "whom", "dmg" }, "Every {iv} sec, once enemies are within {near} yd, a Lightwell rises where you stand. For {dur} sec it strikes {whom} within {range} yd of it for {dmg} Holy damage every second." },
    { "^里程碑。每次冒险开始时你就拥有神圣震击，它的每一道光束都会跳向另外2个敌人，造成(.-)%%的效果。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. You start every run with Holy Shock, and each of its bolts leaps to 2 more enemies for {v}% of it." },
    { "^里程碑。你的攻击带毒：每次挥砍和打击都会附加致命毒药，在6秒内造成相当于该次攻击(.-)%%的伤害。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. Your strikes poison: every swing and every strike adds Deadly Poison, {v}% of the hit over 6 sec." },
    { "^里程碑。每击杀(.-)个敌人，你就会肾上腺素爆发：一次免费的冲动，11秒内冷却恢复速度加快60%%。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. Every {v}th kill floods you with adrenaline: a free Adrenaline Rush, your cooldowns 60% faster for 11 sec." },
    { "^你的地狱烈焰造成的伤害提高(.-)%%。每次脉冲有(.-)%%的几率使每个被灼烧的敌人减速40%%，持续3秒。$", { "v", "v2" }, "Your Hellfire deals {v}% more damage. Each pulse has a {v2}% chance to slow each enemy it burns by 40% for 3 sec." },
    { "^每次冒险都会给你的(.-)天赋经验：存活时间、击杀、首领和胜利，越难的区域越多。重置天赋免费。$", { "class" }, "Every run pays your {class}s talent experience: time survived, kills, bosses and a win, more in harder zones. Respecs are free." },
    { "^里程碑。每次冒险开始时你就拥有审判，每次审判还会对目标附近的2个敌人造成(.-)%%的效果。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. You start every run with Judgement, and every Judgement also strikes 2 more enemies near its target for {v}% of it." },
    { "^终极天赋。两只幽魂之狼在你身边作战，它们的撕咬带有风怒：有(.-)%%的几率立即再打击两次。$", { "v" }, "Capstone. Two spirit wolves fight beside you, and their bites carry Windfury: a {v}% chance to strike twice more at once." },
    { "^向(.-)码内的随机敌人发射(.-)枚飞弹，每枚造成(.-)。附近敌人很少时，多枚飞弹可能命中同一个敌人。$", { "range", "n", "hit" }, "Fires {n} missiles at random enemies within {range} yd for {hit} each. With few enemies near, several can hit the same one." },
    { "^再次选择时，伤害减免提升到(.-)%%后不再增加，而最大生命值会继续成长，超过(.-)%%后越来越少。$", { "dr", "hp" }, "Picked again, its damage reduction grows up to {dr}% and stops there, while its max health keeps growing, by less and less past {hp}%." },
    { "^里程碑。邪恶攻击和剔骨会延伸开来：每次命中还会对目标附近的2个敌人造成(.-)%%的效果。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. Sinister Strike and Eviscerate fly on: each hit also strikes 2 more enemies near its target for {v}% of it." },
    { "^里程碑。暗影箭会分裂：每一枚命中的暗影箭都会分叉击中另外2个敌人，造成(.-)%%的效果。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. Shadow Bolt splits: every bolt that lands forks to 2 more enemies for {v}% of it." },
    { "^对(.-)码内最近的敌人造成(.-)，然后跳跃到上一个目标(.-)码内最多(.-)个其他敌人，每次跳跃减弱8%%。$", { "range", "hit", "r", "n" }, "Strikes the nearest enemy within {range} yd for {hit}, then jumps to up to {n} more enemies within {r} yd of the last, 8% weaker with each jump." },
    { "^提高敌群难度以获得更多天赋经验和更高的首领掉落几率，最高x(.-)。超过后冒险只会更难。$", { "max" }, "Make the horde harder for more talent experience and better odds of boss loot, up to x{max}. Past that the run only gets harder." },
    { "^终极天赋。邪恶攻击额外命中(.-)个敌人，而且你会自动出手：每3秒一次免费的邪恶攻击。$", { "v" }, "Capstone. Sinister Strike strikes {v} more enemy, and you strike on your own: a free Sinister Strike every 3 sec." },
    { "^里程碑。你施放的每次治疗还会对12码内的所有敌人造成相当于治疗量(.-)%%的自然伤害。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. Every heal you cast also strikes every enemy within 12 yd for {v}% of the healing as Nature damage." },
    { "^里程碑。惩击和神圣之火的暴击会点燃目标，在6秒内造成相当于该次攻击(.-)%%的伤害。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. Smite and Holy Fire critical strikes set their target alight for {v}% of the hit over 6 sec." },
    { "^你的持续伤害法术跳动速度加快(.-)%%：同样时间内跳动更多次，造成更多伤害。最多(.-)%%。$", { "v", "max" }, "Your damage over time spells tick {v}% faster: more ticks, and more damage, in the same time. {max}% at most." },
    { "^你的恶魔造成的伤害提高(.-)%%，持续(.-)秒。当敌人进入30码内且有恶魔为你作战时施放。$", { "d", "dur" }, "Your demons deal {d}% more damage for {dur} sec. Cast once enemies are within 30 yd and a demon fights for you." },
    { "^里程碑。自动射击可以穿透：每支箭还会打击目标后方的1个敌人，造成(.-)%%的效果。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. Auto Shot pierces: every arrow also strikes 1 enemy beyond its target for {v}% of it." },
    { "^你的图腾消失时会爆发火焰，对其(.-)码内的所有敌人造成(.-)点火焰伤害，每(.-)秒最多一次。$", { "r", "dmg", "iv" }, "Your totems explode in flame when they expire, dealing {dmg} Fire damage to every enemy within {r} yd of them, at most once every {iv} sec." },
    { "^点击一件装备查看其加成和掉落它的首领。 · (.-)：已穿戴 · (.-)：作为外观显示$", { "worn", "look" }, "Click a piece for its bonuses and the bosses that drop it. · {worn} worn · {look} shown as a look" },
    { "^里程碑。你的陷阱会困住命中的敌人：陷阱每次命中有(.-)%%的几率使敌人定身2秒。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. Your traps hold what they hit: every hit of a trap has a {v}% chance to root the enemy for 2 sec." },
    { "^里程碑。你的暴击撕开目标：目标流血，在6秒内受到相当于该次攻击(.-)%%的伤害。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. Your critical strikes rip the target open: it bleeds for {v}% of the hit over 6 sec." },
    { "^任何职业都能展示的外观，不提供任何属性。每个都来自一项成就。已收集 (.-)/(.-)。$", { "n", "total" }, "Looks any class can show; they add nothing. Each comes with an achievement. {n} of {total} collected." },
    { "^里程碑。你的暗影法术还会对被击中的目标造成相当于其最大生命值(.-)%%的伤害。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. Your Shadow spells also strike what they hit for {v}% of its maximum health." },
    { "^里程碑。奥术飞弹额外发射(.-)枚飞弹，每枚飞弹都会以全额伤害跳向另一个敌人。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. Arcane Missiles fires {v} more missiles, and each missile leaps on to another enemy for its full damage." },
    { "^收回花在特权上的所有点数，以便重新分配。战袍保留。此存档剩余(.-)/(.-)次重置。$", { "resets", "total" }, "Takes back every point spent on perks, to spend again. Tabards are kept. {resets} of {total} resets left on this save." },
    { "^死亡缠绕会立即对目标造成你的吸取生命剩余伤害的(.-)%%，且不会消耗吸取生命。$", { "v" }, "Death Coil instantly deals {v}% of your Drain Life's remaining damage on its target, without consuming it." },
    { "^里程碑。节能施法：你施放的每个法术都有(.-)%%的几率触发一次免费的魔爆术。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. Clearcasting: every spell you cast has a {v}% chance to set off a free Arcane Explosion." },
    { "^里程碑。你的火焰暴击会点燃目标，在4秒内造成相当于该次攻击(.-)%%的伤害。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. Your Fire critical strikes ignite the target for {v}% of the hit over 4 sec." },
    { "^你的恶魔的攻击有(.-)%%的几率产生全额伤害的回响。这是它们唯一的回响来源。$", { "v" }, "Your demons' attacks have a {v}% chance to Echo for full damage. This is their only Echo source." },
    { "^你对受你的持续伤害效果（如撕裂和重伤）影响的敌人造成的伤害提高(.-)%%。$", { "v" }, "You deal {v}% more damage to enemies suffering your damage-over-time effects, such as Rend and Deep Wounds." },
    { "^里程碑。寒冰箭命中时会碎裂：对目标5码内的所有敌人造成其伤害的(.-)%%。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. Frostbolt splinters on impact: {v}% of its damage to every enemy within 5 yd of its target." },
    { "^每命中一个敌人，为你提供可吸收(.-)点伤害的护盾，最多(.-)点，直到护盾破碎。$", { "n", "max" }, "Shields you against {n} damage for every enemy hit, up to {max}, until it breaks." },
    { "^里程碑。你的暴击使目标流血，在6秒内受到相当于该次攻击(.-)%%的伤害。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. Your critical strikes make the target bleed for {v}% of the hit over 6 sec." },
    { "^每口光明之泉的持续时间都长于下一口的等待时间：最多可同时存在(.-)口。$", { "n" }, "Each well outlasts the wait for the next: up to {n} stand at once." },
    { "^吸收你受到的接下来(.-)点伤害，即最大生命值的(.-)%%。护盾破碎后再次施放。$", { "amount", "share" }, "Absorbs the next {amount} damage you take, {share}% of your max health. Cast again once the shield breaks." },
    { "^里程碑。你的暴击有(.-)%%的几率掷出一次免费的驱邪术，每秒最多一次。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. Your critical strikes have a {v}% chance to hurl a free Exorcism, at most once a second." },
    { "^你的神圣暴击会为你恢复相当于最大生命值(.-)%%的生命，每秒最多一次。$", { "v" }, "Your Holy critical strikes heal you for {v}% of your maximum health, at most once a second." },
    { "^里程碑。你的闪电箭、地震术和冰霜震击有(.-)%%的几率立即再打击两次。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. Your Lightning Bolts, Earth Shocks and Frost Shocks have a {v}% chance to strike twice more at once." },
    { "^里程碑。你的冰霜法术有(.-)%%的几率将命中的目标冻结在原地1%.5秒。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. Your Frost spells have a {v}% chance to freeze what they hit in place for 1.5 sec." },
    { "^敌人进入25码内时，在你身边放置一个图腾，持续(.-)秒。每(.-)秒，它(.-)。$", { "dur", "every", "does" }, "Drops a totem beside you for {dur} sec once enemies are within 25 yd. Every {every} sec it {does}." },
    { "^(.-)为你恢复(.-)点生命值，即最大生命值的(.-)%%。生命值低于85%%时施放。$", { "over", "amount", "share" }, "Heals you for {amount}, {share}% of your max health, {over}. Cast when you fall below 85% health." },
    { "^再次选择时会继续成长：在(.-)之前每次略少一些，超过之后越来越少。$", { "ceiling" }, "Picked again, it keeps growing, by a little less each time up to {ceiling} and by less and less past it." },
    { "^至尊：每12秒，你的高阶恶魔的下一次攻击获得强化，伤害%+(.-)%%。$", { "v" }, "Supremacy: every 12 sec, your greater demons empower their next attack for +{v}% damage." },
    { "^里程碑。你施放的每个法术都有(.-)%%的几率降下一次免费的星火术。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. Every spell you cast has an {v}% chance to call down a free Starfire." },
    { "^(.-)战袍栏位的外观，不提供任何属性。战场战袍随其区域成就获得。$", { "class" }, "A look for your {class}s' tabard slot; it adds nothing. Battleground tabards come with their zone's achievement." },
    { "^战斗怒吼和你的其他伤害、急速、护盾和荆棘增益效果增强(.-)%%。$", { "v" }, "Battle Shout and your other damage, haste, shield and thorns buffs are {v}% stronger." },
    { "^里程碑。你的宠物的撕咬有(.-)%%的几率触发一次免费的多重射击。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. Your pets' bites have a {v}% chance to fire a free Multi-Shot." },
    { "^敌人用近战攻击你时，有(.-)%%的几率以一次免费的鬼魅攻击回击。$", { "v" }, "When an enemy strikes you in melee, {v}% chance to answer with a free Ghostly Strike." },
    { "^你的火焰法术有(.-)%%的几率使命中的目标减速40%%，持续3秒。$", { "v" }, "Your Fire spells have a {v}% chance to slow what they hit by 40% for 3 sec." },
    { "^(.-)被击杀了！它的巢穴交出了财宝和力量，其他守护者变得更强。$", { "_1" }, "{_1} is slain! Its lair yields treasure and its strength, and the other guardians grow stronger." },
    { "^(.-)为(.-)掉落(.-)品质的装备。每件装备单独掷骰，重复获得没有效果。$", { "zone", "class", "rarity" }, "{zone} drops {rarity} pieces for a {class}. Each piece drops on its own roll; a duplicate adds nothing." },
    { "^超过上限的伤害减免不会浪费：每1%%转化为(.-)%%的伤害提高。$", { "v" }, "Damage reduction past the cap is not wasted: each 1% of it becomes {v}% more damage." },
    { "^敌人用近战攻击你时，有(.-)%%的几率触发一个免费的爆炸陷阱。$", { "v" }, "When an enemy strikes you in melee, {v}% chance to set off a free Explosive Trap." },
    { "^敌人用近战攻击你时，有(.-)%%的几率施放一次免费的纠缠根须。$", { "v" }, "When an enemy strikes you in melee, {v}% chance to cast a free Entangling Roots." },
    { "^等级(.-)！%$B%$B选择一个法术。它的稀有度决定了它的强度。$", { "level" }, "Level {level}!$B$BChoose a spell. Its rarity decides how strong it is." },
    { "^你施放的每个法术额外造成相当于你最大生命值(.-)%%的伤害。$", { "v" }, "Every spell you cast deals an extra {v}% of your maximum health." },
    { "^你对被击晕、定身、减速或逃跑的敌人造成的伤害提高(.-)%%。$", { "v" }, "You deal {v}% more damage to stunned, rooted, slowed or fleeing enemies." },
    { "^你对被冻结、击晕、减速或逃跑的敌人造成的伤害提高(.-)%%。$", { "v" }, "You deal {v}% more damage to frozen, stunned, slowed or fleeing enemies." },
    { "^敌人用近战攻击你时，有(.-)%%的几率以一次免费的挥击回击。$", { "v" }, "When an enemy strikes you in melee, {v}% chance to answer with a free Swipe." },
    { "^(.-)：该处(.-)码内的所有敌人每(.-)秒受到(.-)点(.-)伤害，持续(.-)秒，共计(.-)点。$", { "place", "r", "every", "tick", "school", "dur", "total" }, "{place}: every enemy within {r} yd of that spot takes {tick} {school} damage every {every} sec for {dur} sec, {total} in all." },
    { "^(.-) 初始法术为(.-)；每次升级提供三个该职业的法术。(.-)生命值。$", { "blurb", "spell", "hp" }, "{blurb} Starts with {spell}; every level offers three of its spells. {hp} health." },
    { "^你的(.-)获得了(.-)点天赋经验：1个新天赋点！去军械库分配吧。$", { "class", "xp" }, "Your {class}s earn {xp} talent experience: 1 new talent point! Spend it in the armory." },
    { "^盾牌猛击的护盾额外吸收相当于你最大生命值(.-)%%的伤害。$", { "v" }, "Shield Slam's shield holds {v}% more of your maximum health." },
    { "^在你的奉献中燃烧的敌人在3秒内受到你的伤害提高(.-)%%。$", { "v" }, "Enemies burning in your Consecration take {v}% more damage from you for 3 sec." },
    { "^里程碑。你每施放(.-)个法术，就会追加一次免费的闪电链。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. Every {v}th spell you cast is followed by a free Chain Lightning." },
    { "^暴击会让你进入乱舞状态：5秒内冷却恢复速度加快(.-)%%。$", { "v" }, "A critical strike sends you into a flurry: cooldowns recover {v}% faster for 5 sec." },
    { "^使你免疫所有伤害，持续(.-)秒。生命值低于35%%时施放。$", { "dur" }, "Makes you immune to all damage for {dur} sec. Cast when you fall below 35% health." },
    { "^你的(.-)获得了(.-)点天赋经验：(.-)个新天赋点！去军械库分配吧。$", { "class", "xp", "n" }, "Your {class}s earn {xp} talent experience: {n} new talent points! Spend them in the armory." },
    { "^把每个插件的文件夹（适用于魔兽世界1%.12）放到(.-)$", { "path" }, "Put each addon's folder (made for WoW 1.12) in {path}" },
    { "^里程碑。每击杀(.-)个敌人，就会释放一次免费的旋风斩。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. Every {v}th kill unleashes a free Whirlwind." },
    { "^被挫志怒吼击中的敌人在6秒内受到你的伤害提高(.-)%%。$", { "v" }, "Enemies hit by Demoralizing Shout take {v}% more damage from you for 6 sec." },
    { "^奉献的每一跳额外造成相当于你最大生命值(.-)%%的伤害。$", { "v" }, "Every tick of Consecration deals an extra {v}% of your maximum health." },
    { "^里程碑。你每射击(.-)次，就会追加一次免费的瞄准射击。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. Every {v}th shot you fire is followed by a free Aimed Shot." },
    { "^你的暗影法术有(.-)%%的几率使命中的目标昏迷1%.5秒。$", { "v" }, "Your Shadow spells have a {v}% chance to stun what they hit for 1.5 sec." },
    { "^里程碑。闪电箭和闪电链有(.-)%%的几率免费再打击一次。$", { "v" }, "Milestone. Lightning Bolt and Chain Lightning have a {v}% chance to strike again for free." },
    { "^破碎的护盾会爆发，对(.-)码内的敌人造成其吸收量(.-)的伤害$", { "radius", "frac" }, "A broken shield bursts for {frac} of what it absorbed on enemies within {radius} yd" },
    { "^至尊：你的末日守卫对首领和精英造成的伤害提高(.-)%%。$", { "v" }, "Supremacy: your Doomguard deals {v}% more damage to bosses and elites." },
    { "^奉献的护盾额外吸收相当于你最大生命值(.-)%%的伤害。$", { "v" }, "Consecration's shield holds {v}% more of your maximum health." },
    { "^火焰新星、熔岩图腾和烈焰震击造成的伤害提高(.-)%%。$", { "v" }, "Fire Nova, Magma Totem and Flame Shock deal {v}% more damage." },
    { "^你的持续伤害法术现在可以在一个敌人身上叠加(.-)次。$", { "n" }, "Your damage over time spells now stack {n} times on one enemy." },
    { "^冷却时间在免疫结束时开始计算：每次施放间隔(.-)秒。$", { "total" }, "Its cooldown starts when the immunity ends: {total} sec from one cast to the next." },
    { "^你每拥有10%%伤害减免，造成的所有伤害提高(.-)%%。$", { "v" }, "Increases all damage you deal by {v}% for every 10% damage reduction you have." },
    { "^已收集(.-)/(.-)件  ·  装备和外观按职业分别保存$", { "n", "total" }, "{n} of {total} pieces collected  ·  gear and looks are kept per class" },
    { "^你对生命值低于30%%的敌人造成的伤害提高(.-)%%。$", { "v" }, "You deal {v}% more damage to enemies below 30% health." },
    { "^雷霆一击额外造成相当于你最大生命值(.-)%%的伤害。$", { "v" }, "Thunder Clap deals an extra {v}% of your maximum health." },
    { "^盾牌猛击额外造成相当于你最大生命值(.-)%%的伤害。$", { "v" }, "Shield Slam deals an extra {v}% of your maximum health." },
    { "^制裁之锤额外造成相当于你最大生命值(.-)%%的伤害。$", { "v" }, "Hammer of Justice deals an extra {v}% of your maximum health." },
    { "^熔岩图腾的范围扩大(.-)%%，灼热图腾攻击更多目标。$", { "v" }, "Magma Totem reaches {v}% farther and Searing Totem fires at more targets." },
    { "^你的火焰法术有(.-)%%的几率使命中的目标昏迷1秒。$", { "v" }, "Your Fire spells have a {v}% chance to stun what they hit for 1 sec." },
    { "^为你恢复(.-)点生命值，每命中一个敌人额外恢复(.-)点。$", { "n", "n" }, "Heals you for {n}, plus {n} for every enemy hit." },
    { "^身中(.-)死亡的敌人会爆炸，造成其最大生命值(.-)的伤害$", { "spell", "frac" }, "Enemies that die with {spell} on them explode for {frac} of their max health" },
    { "^再次选择时几乎按该选择的全部价值成长，最高(.-)。$", { "ceiling" }, "Picked again, it grows by nearly the pick's whole worth, up to {ceiling}." },
    { "^(.-)期间击杀的敌人会爆炸，造成其最大生命值(.-)的伤害$", { "spell", "frac" }, "Enemies you kill during {spell} explode for {frac} of their max health" },
    { "^至尊：你的地狱火的地狱烈焰造成的伤害提高(.-)%%。$", { "v" }, "Supremacy: your Infernal's Hellfire deals {v}% more damage." },
    { "^导出的存档在(.-)。把存档文件放到那里即可导入。$", { "path" }, "Exports go to {path}. Put a save file there to import it." },
    { "^你每拥有10%%伤害减免，造成的伤害提高(.-)%%。$", { "v" }, "You deal {v}% more damage for every 10% damage reduction you have." },
    { "^被(.-)击杀的敌人会爆炸，造成其最大生命值(.-)的伤害$", { "spell", "frac" }, "Enemies {spell} kills explode for {frac} of their max health" },
    { "^你击杀的敌人会爆炸，造成其最大生命值(.-)的伤害$", { "frac" }, "Enemies you kill explode for {frac} of their max health" },
    { "^超出上限的每1%%伤害减免使你的伤害提高(.-)%%。$", { "v" }, "Each 1% of damage reduction past the cap increases your damage by {v}%." },
    { "^(.-)的锁链正在吸取你的生命！远离它以挣断锁链！$", { "_1" }, "{_1}'s tether drains you! Get away to break it!" },
    { "^已导入(.-)：你的进度现在就是该文件中的进度。$", { "name" }, "Imported {name}: your progress is now the one it holds." },
    { "^敌人对你造成的近战伤害的(.-)%%会反弹给他们。$", { "v" }, "{v}% of the damage enemies deal you in melee is dealt back to them." },
    { "^你获得了(.-)%%伤害、(.-)最大生命值和每秒(.-)生命值。$", { "damage", "health", "regen" }, "You have gained {damage}% damage, {health} maximum health and {regen} health per second." },
    { "^对生命值低于30%%的敌人造成的伤害提高(.-)。$", { "p" }, "Increases damage dealt to enemies below 30% health by {p}." },
    { "^你的伤害、急速、护盾和荆棘增益效果增强(.-)。$", { "p" }, "Your damage, haste, shield and thorns buffs are {p} stronger." },
    { "^你死亡时以一半生命值复活。最多储存(.-)条命。$", { "n" }, "Returns you to life at half health when you die. Holds {n} lives at most." },
    { "^冰霜新星、冰锥术和暴风雪的范围扩大(.-)%%。$", { "v" }, "Frost Nova, Cone of Cold and Blizzard reach {v}% farther." },
    { "^被命中的敌人造成的伤害降低(.-)%%，持续(.-)秒。$", { "p", "d" }, "Enemies hit deal {p}% less damage for {d} sec." },
    { "^致命一击会改为让你保留(.-)生命值，每(.-)秒一次$", { "heal", "cd" }, "A killing blow leaves you at {heal} health instead, once every {cd} sec" },
    { "^盾牌猛击造成的伤害提高(.-)%%，冷却更快。$", { "v" }, "Shield Slam deals {v}% more damage and recovers faster." },
    { "^制裁之锤造成的伤害提高(.-)%%，冷却更快。$", { "v" }, "Hammer of Justice deals {v}% more damage and recovers faster." },
    { "^自动射击和多重射击造成的伤害提高(.-)%%。$", { "v" }, "Auto Shot and Multi-Shot deal {v}% more damage." },
    { "^震荡射击和瞄准射击的冷却时间缩短(.-)%%。$", { "v" }, "Concussive Shot and Aimed Shot cooldowns are {v}% shorter." },
    { "^灼热图腾和熔岩图腾的冷却时间缩短(.-)%%。$", { "v" }, "Searing and Magma Totem cooldowns are {v}% shorter." },
    { "^烈焰震击和冰霜震击造成的伤害提高(.-)%%。$", { "v" }, "Flame Shock and Frost Shock deal {v}% more damage." },
    { "^死亡缠绕和吸取生命的冷却时间缩短(.-)%%。$", { "v" }, "Death Coil and Drain Life cooldowns are {v}% shorter." },
    { "^对你前方(.-)码锥形范围内的所有敌人造成(.-)。$", { "cone", "hit" }, "Hits every enemy in a {cone} yd cone in front of you for {hit}." },
    { "^在(.-)秒内，近战攻击你的敌人受到(.-)点伤害。(.-)$", { "dur", "n", "in_fight" }, "For {dur} sec, enemies that hit you in melee take {n} damage.{in_fight}" },
    { "^(.-)为你治疗期间，你造成伤害的(.-)也会治疗你$", { "spell", "p" }, "While {spell} heals you, {p} of the damage you deal heals you too" },
    { "^你的地狱火和末日守卫造成的伤害提高(.-)。$", { "p" }, "Increases the damage of your Infernal and Doomguard by {p}." },
    { "^所有伤害和你的恶魔的暴击几率提高(.-)%%。$", { "v" }, "Increases all damage and your demons' critical strike chance by {v}%." },
    { "^你的怒吼范围扩大(.-)%%，持续时间更长。$", { "v" }, "Your shouts reach {v}% farther and last longer." },
    { "^你的持续伤害效果造成的伤害提高(.-)%%。$", { "v" }, "Your damage-over-time effects deal {v}% more damage." },
    { "^烈焰风暴和冲击波造成的伤害提高(.-)%%。$", { "v" }, "Flamestrike and Blast Wave deal {v}% more damage." },
